MODIFICATIONS
-------------
Modified 2026-10-28 by rzhy1 (https://github.com/rzhy1):

  * Migrated the extension from Manifest V2 to Manifest V3: added
    service_worker.js (offscreen-document bootstrap plus browser UI proxy) and
    bgbridge.js (message bridge used by the popup, options and subscribe pages).
  * Renamed this distribution to "RSS Live Links MV3" and documented that it is
    a fork. The internal configuration id ("RSS Live Links") and the bookmark
    folder name are intentionally unchanged so existing user data, exported
    configurations and bookmark folders keep working.
  * Bug fixes: items no longer fail to open in a tab from the offscreen
    document, badge text and icon updates work under MV3, read/unread state no
    longer needs a second click, feed parse failures report the server response,
    tab feed candidates are scoped and cleaned up correctly (including races on
    tab close), and several original typos / variable scope errors were fixed.
  * Performance and memory work: cached icon animation frames, truncated item
    descriptions in state snapshots, exponential backoff for failing feeds,
    debounced seen-state persistence, SHA-256 hashing of feed source text, and
    cancellation of queued web-worker requests.
  * Feed discovery: stricter feed detection (content-type allow list, explicit
    rejection of HTML documents), probing of 24 common feed paths per site
    origin with a 5 minute cache, HEAD-to-GET fallback for servers that reject
    HEAD, and URL/title based de-duplication of equivalent feeds.
  * Added LICENSE, COPYING, NOTICE and the privacy policy.

Modified files: manifest.json, background.js, background.html, background
scripts referenced by it, feed.js, feedWorker.js, findrss.js, tabrss.js,
xmlhttp.js, popup.js, popup.html, context.js, subscribe.js, subscribe.html,
updated.js, options.html, options/options.js, options/i18n.js, options/ui.js,
_locales/*/messages.json.

New files: service_worker.js, bgbridge.js, LICENSE, COPYING, NOTICE,
PRIVACY.md.


